                <mxCell id="105" value="&lt;b&gt;1. One workspace per Pull Request.&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#000000&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;2.&amp;nbsp; Several Dahboards allowed as long as they share a workspace.&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;3. Only modified Items are processed.&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;" vertex="1" parent="1">
